stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  state "未发起" as not_started
  state "预审中" as prechecking
  state "AI 初审中" as ai_running
  state "AI 初审失败" as ai_failed
  state "待人工复核" as pending_review
  state "已通过" as approved
  state "已退回" as returned
  state "已失效" as invalidated
  [*] --> prechecking: 来单，流水线以系统身份自动发起
  [*] --> not_started: 平台上线前已有的单据
  not_started --> prechecking: 人点「发起 AI 初审」
  prechecking --> ai_running: 九安预审完成
  prechecking --> ai_failed: 预审未完成
  ai_running --> pending_review: 结果通过检查
  ai_running --> ai_failed: 调用失败，或结果修正一次仍不合格
  ai_failed --> ai_running: 系统自动重试一次（隔 5 秒）/ 人点重试
  ai_failed --> pending_review: 人点「转人工」（不带 AI 初审结果）
  pending_review --> prechecking: 「规则 / 原件已更新」，人点重跑（新一轮）
  pending_review --> approved: 人工复核：通过
  pending_review --> returned: 人工复核：退回
  pending_review --> invalidated: 单据有新版本<br/>（预审中、AI 初审中、AI 初审失败时同样）
  invalidated --> prechecking: 系统按新版本自动开新一轮
  approved --> [*]
  returned --> [*]
  note right of pending_review
    不论 AI 判通过还是不通过都要人复核；
    和 AI 结论相反要写理由，退回要写说明
  end note
  class approved good
  class returned risk
  class ai_failed warn
  class invalidated pocOnly
